  triage:description "In the daemon-build-signing-hook lint script (Cipher's devcert-signing tooling PR #727), test_package_filter_without_daemon_is_not_checked is a byte-for-byte duplicate of the pre-existing test_non_daemon_build_is_not_checked. It adds no coverage for the multi -p-flag branch that is-daemon-build() is supposed to newly handle. Confirmed by req-qa during QA-3 review of commit 4c867d69." ;
